   "jp": "⟦rb⟧その人⟦rt⟧⟦rbc⟧●●●⟦/r⟧は、開けた扉のドアノブを掴んだまま、呆然とした顔でこちらを見つめていた。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:26400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「え？ え？ え？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:26500",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "その人は――"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:26600",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "――宮代、拓留だった。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:26700",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "月明かりしかないのに、宮代拓留の顔が真っ赤になっているのが分かる。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:26800",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "華の一世一代の『告白』を聞かれていたのは明白だった。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:26900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「えええええええええええええ！！！！！！！？？？？？？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ななななな、なんで！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「いやー、こうでもしないと、告るとか無理っぽいからさー」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でででで、でもでもでも！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だって、自分自身には嘘をつけないって……！！？？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「えー？ あたしそんなこと言ってないよ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「『自分自身に嘘をつく必要は無い』って言っただけ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「嘘をついちゃいけないわけじゃない」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そんなあーーー！！！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「まあ、丸一日つき合ってもらったことへの、あたしからのプレゼントだね」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:27900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あとはあんたが上手くやんな」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": "미야시로 타쿠루",
   "jp": "「じゃあね」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28100",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "胸の奥から、すっとなにかがいなくなった。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": "미야시로 타쿠루",
   "jp": "「あ……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28300",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "体が少しだけ軽くなった気がした。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28400",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "それは、嬉しいことでも、悲しいことでもあるような気がした。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28500",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "胸に手を押さえて、呟く。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": "미야시로 타쿠루",
   "jp": "「……ありがとう」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28700",
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": null,
   "speaker_ko": null,
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "미야시로 타쿠루",
   "jp": "そして顔をあげ、宮代拓留の方に歩いて行った。"
  },
  {
   "id": "clka11:28800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "宮代拓留",
   "speaker_ko": "미야시로 타쿠루",
   "prev_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "next_speaker": "카즈키 하나",
   "jp": "「……か、香月？」"
  },
